      "author": "Tried By Fire",
      "authorHandle": "@TriedByFire",
      "text": "In scripture, there is a concept I refer to as “folding.” Much of scripture is historical, so I don’t want to overemphasize this point, but when read in its proper context, many events involving Israel throughout the Old Testament foreshadow what is to come for this world. God has repeatedly proven that Israel is His people and has given them specific commands to be an example to the world. However, the Israelites often drifted away from God, prompting Him to send prophets to capture their attention.",
