      "verse": 6,
      "startVerse": 1,
      "endVerse": 9,
      "author": "Tried By Fire",
      "authorHandle": "@TriedByFire",
      "text": "They are receiving their own punishment. They were given a specific symbol for such things. They sin against the Lord, and there was a sacrifice for it that they could make with repentance. Instead, they have neglected the true meaning of the sacrifice, doing it out of necessity rather than out of desire and compassion for the Lord, and they have started to take their own sins upon themselves. This is the life of a man without Christ. If there is someone who doesn’t know Christ today, they are walking around in their wounds, bruises, and putrefying sores out of their own free volition!",
