      "author": "1 Chronicles 29:11-12",
      "authorHandle": "",
      "text": "\"Thine, O LORD, is the greatness, and the power, and the glory, and the victory, and the majesty: for all that is in the heaven and in the earth is thine; thine is the kingdom, O LORD, and thou art exalted as head above all. Both riches and honour come of thee, and thou reignest over all; and in thine hand is power and might; and in thine hand it is to make great, and to give strength unto all.\" 1 Chronicles 29:11-12",
      "likes": 0,
      "isLikedByUser": false,
      "isBookmarkedByUser": false,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z",
