      "endVerse": 16,
      "author": "Tried By Fire",
      "authorHandle": "@TriedByFire",
      "text": "They are crying, ultimately, for relief. They still aren’t crying for mercy from the Lord. They think that wine is what will bring them joy. They need something to tide them over. It won’t work. The joy of drinking is gone. It would have never been sufficient for them anyway.",
