      "text": "Isaiah sees the destruction (even though he can hear the singing) and he is undone by it. He finds it to be miserable. It will be quick as well. Everything will seemingly be going well, and then suddenly… destruction and chaos.",
      "likes": 0,
      "isLikedByUser": false,
      "isBookmarkedByUser": false,
