      "author": "Tried By Fire",
      "authorHandle": "@TriedByFire",
      "text": "The children of God do not experience the same kind of fear. We are not afraid of God’s wrath. We are not afraid of God’s judgment. We know that the Earth deserves it honestly.",
      "likes": 0,
