      "chapter": 24,
      "verse": 17,
      "startVerse": 17,
      "endVerse": 20,
      "author": "Tried By Fire",
      "authorHandle": "@TriedByFire",
      "text": "The world will also face “the pit,” which refers to Hell or Death. People will be concerned about it to the point of worry, but they won’t do anything to save themselves.",
