      "chapter": 32,
      "verse": 9,
      "startVerse": 9,
      "endVerse": 15,
      "author": "Tried By Fire",
      "authorHandle": "@TriedByFire",
      "text": "Yeah, woman! You careless daughters! It might seem strange that Isaiah is just pointing out women here. The truth is, women are not very good at listening, is why… I’m just kidding! Please don’t hurt me. Honestly, he probably points out women specifically for a couple of reasons. One is that they are far more inclined to listen than men are. Men are really just flat-out dumb. Two is because God considers the land of His people as His daughter.",
      "likes": 0,
      "isLikedByUser": false,
      "isBookmarkedByUser": false,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z",
      "kind": "comment",
      "quoteStyle": null,
