          "author": "Tried By Fire",
          "authorHandle": "@TriedByFire",
          "text": "Perhaps you read this and think, “What good is righteousness in a fruitful field? What good is judgment in the wilderness? This all seems kind of random.” It’s more of an overall occurrence. We should pay attention to the Godly attributes here.",
