          "verse": 2,
          "startVerse": 1,
          "endVerse": 4,
          "author": "Jeremiah 23:19",
          "authorHandle": "",
          "text": "\"Behold, a whirlwind of the LORD is gone forth in fury, even a grievous whirlwind: it shall fall grievously upon the head of the wicked.\" Jeremiah 23:19",
