          "chapter": 35,
          "verse": 4,
          "startVerse": 3,
          "endVerse": 4,
          "author": "Hebrews 10:30",
          "authorHandle": "",
          "text": "\"For we know him that hath said, Vengeance belongeth unto me, I will recompense, saith the Lord. And again, The Lord shall judge his people.\" Hebrews 10:30",
